Z||000000||Spyder||01-26-2000||04:02 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/suspension.jpg"> <BR>I just painted the calipers, and yes I got a little messy with the yellow paint.<P>Here’s what I got:<BR>Goodridge braided brake lines <BR>Pro Thane poly bushings<BR>Moog adjustable ball joints <BR>Koni adjustable shocks <BR>Speedway Brake System with vented rotors <BR>ADDCO sway bars <BR>Suspension Techniques springs<P>All I have to do now is get it dialed in right.||||reg||7
